<body>
<div class="Section1">
<h1>Phase 6: Project Testing Phase</h1>
<p style="font-size: 13pt; color: #4a5568;"><strong>ContentGen (BlogNest) API Testing Protocol (Epic 5)</strong></p>

<h2>1. Execution Verification</h2>
<p>Tested using Postman and Thunder Client across all required endpoint vectors:</p>
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>Action</th>
      <th>Endpoint</th>
      <th>Method</th>
      <th>Expected Status</th>
      <th>Result</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td>User Registration</td>
      <td>/api/auth/register</td>
      <td>POST</td>
      <td>201 Created</td>
      <td>Pass</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>User Login</td>
      <td>/api/auth/login</td>
      <td>POST</td>
      <td>200 OK</td>
      <td>Pass</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Create Blogs</td>
      <td>/api/posts</td>
      <td>POST</td>
      <td>201 Created</td>
      <td>Pass</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Fetch Blogs</td>
      <td>/api/posts</td>
      <td>GET</td>
      <td>200 OK</td>
      <td>Pass</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Generate AI Blogs</td>
      <td>/api/ai/generate-blog</td>
      <td>POST</td>
      <td>200 OK</td>
      <td>Pass</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Summarize Blogs</td>
      <td>/api/ai/summarize</td>
      <td>POST</td>
      <td>200 OK</td>
      <td>Pass</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Comment Moderation</td>
      <td>/api/comments/:id/moderate</td>
      <td>PATCH</td>
      <td>200 OK</td>
      <td>Pass</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<h2>2. Postman Collection Verification</h2>
<p>The collection <code>ContentGen.postman_collection.json</code> automates token extraction via post-response scripts and asserts HTTP 200/201 status codes.</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>
